# This folder holds more than the CLI, so the safe way round is to ignore
# everything and then allow back the files that belong in the repo. Add a line
# for anything new you want tracked.
*

!.gitignore
!.dockerignore
!LICENSE
!README.md
!requirements.txt
!monosuite_cli.py
!synapse/
!synapse/**/
!synapse/**/*.py
!synapse/static/*
!synapse/README.md
!synapse/requirements.txt
!synapse/schema.json
!synapse/deploy/
!synapse/deploy/*
!synapse/deploy/.env.example
synapse/deploy/secrets/
!tests/
!tests/*.py
*.sqlite*
*.log

# Never track these, wherever they turn up.
.monosuite_cli.json
*.token
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.env

!CLI-README.md

!synapse/deploy/host/
!synapse/deploy/host/**
**/secrets/
synapse/deploy/host/sites/
